flowchart LR
  C[USB/Built-in Camera] --> CAP[Capture Thread]
  CAP --> Q[Latest Frame Queue\ncapacity 1]
  CAP --> PREVIEW[Local Preview]
  Q --> AI[Person Detector\nHOG or YOLO ONNX]
  AI --> Z[Include/Exclude Zones]
  Z --> G[Visibility + Cooldown Gate]
  G --> F[Best Frame + Local Face Match]
  F --> DB[(SQLite/WAL)]
  DB --> U[Durable Upload Worker]
  U --> S[(Supabase Private Storage + RLS)]
  S --> E[Notify Edge Function]
  E --> FCM[Firebase Cloud Messaging]
  FCM --> A[Android App]
  A --> V[Private Voice Upload]
  V --> RC[Expiring Remote Command]
  RC --> P[Windows Outbound Poller]
  P --> SPK[Safe Speaker Playback]
